msgstr "``/flash`` — filesystem FAT **64 KB**\\ , baca/tulis."

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/arduino-nano-33-ble-sense.rst:716
msgid ""
"The Nano 33 BLE Sense build does not include a ROMFS; ship Python modules on"
" ``/flash`` directly."
msgstr ""
"Build Nano 33 BLE Sense tidak menyertakan ROMFS; kirimkan modul Python di "
"``/flash`` langsung."

